{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55114","headline":"兵要望江南 占六壬第二十八（京本列第十七○四十五首） 四 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占六壬第二十八（京本列第十七○四十五首） 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"占主客，胜负蚤须知。\n甲乙丙丁幷戊子（辛本、川本作「己」、京本作「字」），阳时出战主凶危，此事决（京本作「定」）无疑。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55114.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55114","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}